{
  "autoCompactEnabled": true,
  "_comment": "GRIP-managed settings. User fields (permissions, language, model) are preserved during merge. Do not edit hooks manually — they are regenerated by install.sh --update. outputStyle + showThinkingSummaries + showClearContextOnPlanAccept are GRIP-managed (canonical output style, #2868 W7): force-set on every install/update so the canonical voice cannot silently drift. Per-session opt-out: type 'normal mode' (session-scoped, not persisted here).",
